% Vignette 1 — friendly all-cash tech acquisition by strategic buyer.
%
% $4.2B all-cash acquisition of a mid-cap enterprise SaaS company by
% a larger strategic acquirer in an adjacent vertical. HHI delta < 100
% (no overlap). Debt commitment letters with no market MAC outs.
% Broad MAC carveouts including industry headwinds. RTF of 4% of
% deal value. Founder + private-equity rollover covers 42% of votes.
% No activist position.
%
% Expected behaviour: posterior well above prior (78%); no kickback
% at any reasonable threshold.

observe regulatory(no_antitrust_concern)
observe deal_structure(all_cash)
observe financing(committed_debt_no_market_out)
observe mac_clause(broad_industry_carveouts)
observe rtf_present_above_3pct
observe shareholders(major_holders_locked_up)

? deal_completes_by_drop_dead
